    "en": {
      "trackName": "Tapper Legend: RPG",
      "description": "Rise from peasant to emperor in this addictive idle RPG. Tap to earn gold, build medieval structures, and grow your empire while you're away. Perfect for iPhone and Apple Watch — play anywhere, anytime.\n\nIDLE RPG PROGRESSION\nStart as a peasant with a spear. Upgrade your knight's armor, weapons, and skills. Become a legendary emperor in full regalia.\nBUILD YOUR EMPIRE\nConstruct forges, taverns, markets, and castles. Every building generates passive income — even offline. The bigger your kingdom, the more gold you make.\nONE-TAP CONTROLS\nSimple tap gameplay designed for short sessions. Play on iPhone during commutes or on Apple Watch between meetings.\nPLAY OFFLINE\nNo wifi needed. Your empire grows while you sleep. Come back and collect accumulated gold and rewards.\nDAILY QUESTS & ACHIEVEMENTS\nComplete quests, unlock achievements, and earn rewards. Regular events with unique characters and fates to shape.\nUNLIMITED PROGRESSION\nGoals get more ambitious with every level. No cap — build the ultimate medieval dynasty.\n\nDownload now and start your rise to power. Your throne awaits.",
      "releaseNotes": "New items, quests and contracts mode!",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/tapper-legend-rpg/id6782412312?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "Free",
      "sellerName": "Valery Ivanou",
